        "On the sign-in page, tap Forgot password and enter your account email. Follow the verification steps to set a new password. Check your spam folder if the email does not arrive. Never share the verification code with anyone." to R.string.lang_on_the_sign_in_page_tap_forgot_password_and_enter_your_acc_b4c5ca5,
