        "Open your own Profile and tap Edit profile. Update the available details and save your changes. If a change does not appear, reopen your profile after checking your connection." to R.string.lang_open_your_own_profile_and_tap_edit_profile_update_the_avai_21a4715,
        "How do I edit or delete my post?" to R.string.lang_how_do_i_edit_or_delete_my_post_2f57e83,
        "Find a post you created and open its three-dot menu. Choose Edit to make changes or Delete to remove it. You can manage your own posts; another person's posts cannot be edited from your account." to R.string.lang_find_a_post_you_created_and_open_its_three_dot_menu_choose_3ed987e,
