        "How do I report harmful content or impersonation?" to R.string.lang_how_do_i_report_harmful_content_or_impersonation_10fc6e2,
        "Contact support and choose Privacy & safety. Include the profile name, a post or profile link if you have one, and a clear description. You can add a screenshot in your email app before sending. Share only the information needed to explain the issue." to R.string.lang_contact_support_and_choose_privacy_safety_include_the_prof_e3cd01d,
        "How can I keep my account secure?" to R.string.lang_how_can_i_keep_my_account_secure_2dbc3b8,
